REQUIRED CODE PATTERNS (MUST USE ALL):
- const MELEE_RANGE = ${meleeRange}
- const maxCombatTime = 60000
- const startTime = Date.now()
- while (target && target.isValid && (Date.now() - startTime) < maxCombatTime)
- if (distance <= MELEE_RANGE)
- await bot.attack(target)
- await skills.wait(bot, 300)
- console.log('[${soldierRole}]')
- bot.setControlState('forward', true)

BANNED CODE (DO NOT USE - WILL BREAK):
